{"4514070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Barely Breathing", "steam_appid": 4514070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3D Physics-based Puzzle/Platformer 🐟</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Sheen, a goldfish who tries to escape the house! You jump around pots, knock over water glasses, while making your own path!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/d0a513ba5ec5e608bd85fa634e6b41dd.poster.avif?t=1786972958\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/d0a513ba5ec5e608bd85fa634e6b41dd.webm?t=1786972958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/d0a513ba5ec5e608bd85fa634e6b41dd.mp4?t=1786972958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make a mess!</strong> ☕</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create chaos all around the home, knocking over anything in your path! <i>(Disclaimer: Atleast anything that makes sense for a goldfish to knock over)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/591cc210f3c196f737899069ec9a26ae.poster.avif?t=1786972958\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/591cc210f3c196f737899069ec9a26ae.webm?t=1786972958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/591cc210f3c196f737899069ec9a26ae.mp4?t=1786972958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve unique puzzles! 🧩</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based puzzles seem to be a challenge for Sheen (the goldfish), because she literally has a memory of a goldfish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/dac698d327a9b457b91ec7a5c68ff47a.poster.avif?t=1786972958\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/dac698d327a9b457b91ec7a5c68ff47a.webm?t=1786972958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/dac698d327a9b457b91ec7a5c68ff47a.mp4?t=1786972958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Go on an adventure 🏠</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your owner's home from the living room, to the kitchen <i>(soon to come)</i>, to the bathroom <i>(also soon to come)</i> to the <span class=\"bb_strike\">&lt;redacted&gt;</span> <i>(this one might not be soon to come)</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/9a94c3ff4648f0d6443644a1dd189b65.poster.avif?t=1786972958\" width=1170 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/9a94c3ff4648f0d6443644a1dd189b65.webm?t=1786972958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4514070/extras/9a94c3ff4648f0d6443644a1dd189b65.mp4?t=1786972958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game"